# RN-LMS-2026-08 LMS Release Notes: August 2026

## New

- **Badge reconciliation report.** A daily report lists active forklift badges without a current EHS-FL-201 completion (36 months) or EHS-FL-210 completion (12 months). This addresses audit finding F-2 (AUD-2026-Q2).
- **Agency worker import.** Staffing-agency workers are imported from the vendor management system every night and receive their curriculum on their first day (audit finding F-1).
- **Job code activation check.** HRIS job codes without a curriculum in MAT-ROLE-2026 now block activation until Learning Systems approves (audit finding F-3).

## Changed

- The badge-suspension integration now retries failed events every 15 minutes and alerts Learning Systems after three failures.
- Transcript certificates for EHS-FL-201 now show the evaluator's PIT Evaluator qualification number.

## Fixed

- Leave-of-absence pauses were not applied to items with a due date on the first day of leave.
